(PDF) Too Human to Model:The Uncanny Valley of LLMs in Social Simulation -- When Generative Language Agents Misalign with Modelling Principles (https://www.researchgate.net/publication/393538803_Too_Human_to_ModelThe_Uncanny_Valley_of_LLMs_in_Social_Simulation_--_When_Generative_Language_Agents_Misalign_with_Modelling_Principles)
